@startuml
title JSeats - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Java Developer" as Dev
actor "Command-Line User" as CliUser

package "JSeats (Java)" {

  component "Command-Line Launcher\n(CLI)" as CLI

  component "Caller-Facing Allocation API\n(Entry Point)" as API

  component "Configurable Allocation Processor\n(Workflow Orchestration)" as Processor

  component "Tally Filter API" as FilterAPI
  component "Result Decoration API" as DecorAPI

  interface "Allocation-Method Contract" as MethodContract
  interface "Tally Filter" as TallyFilter
  interface "Result Decorator" as ResultDecorator

  package "Allocation Methods" {
    component "Majority\n(simple, qualified, absolute)" as Majority
    component "Ranked\n(by votes)" as Ranked
    component "Equal Proportions\n(Huntington-Hill)" as EP
    component "Largest Remainder\n(Hare, Droop, Imperiali)" as LR
    component "Highest Averages\n(D'Hondt, Sainte-Lague/Webster,\nImperiali, Danish)" as HA
  }

  package "Data Model" {
    component "Tally" as Tally
    component "Candidate" as Candidate
    component "Result" as Result
    component "Properties" as Properties
  }

  component "XML I/O\n(Tally.fromXML, config/results)" as XML
  component "SeatAllocationException" as Ex

}

Dev --> API : uses
CliUser --> CLI : invokes

API --> Processor : submits tally,\nmethod, parameters
CLI --> Processor : options / files

Processor --> FilterAPI : applies pre-processing
Processor --> DecorAPI : applies post-processing
Processor --> MethodContract : executes selected method

FilterAPI ..> TallyFilter : <<realizes>>
DecorAPI ..> ResultDecorator : <<realizes>>

MethodContract <|.. Majority
MethodContract <|.. Ranked
MethodContract <|.. EP
MethodContract <|.. LR
MethodContract <|.. HA

MethodContract --> Tally : protected view
MethodContract --> Properties : configuration
MethodContract --> Result : returns

API --> Result : returns
API --> Ex : reports failure

Processor --> Ex : signals failure

CLI --> XML : reads/writes
API --> XML : loads tally

Tally "1" o-- "*" Candidate : contains
Processor --> Tally
Processor --> Properties
Processor --> Result

@enduml
